{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"no\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"Among Freezers, beta power was lower during FOG compared to during forward walking without FOG (N = 8 STNs, F(1,51) = 14.45, P < 0.001, Table 4 ).\",\n    \"When Freezers exhibited FOG, beta power was even lower and neural entropy increased in the alpha band.\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"Among Freezers, beta power was lower during FOG compared to during forward walking without FOG (N = 8 STNs, F(1,51) = 14.45, P < 0.001, Table 4 ).\",\n    \"Freezers demonstrated lower beta power and greater alpha SampEn during FOG compared to walking without FOG.\",\n    \"When Freezers exhibited FOG, beta power was even lower and neural entropy increased in the alpha band.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"原文明确报告，在Freezers中，实际FOG期间的STN beta功率相对于无FOG的前向行走期间下降（lower），且结论部分进一步强调FOG期间beta功率甚至更低（even lower）。因此，报告所称实际FOG期间beta功率上升，与论文全文直接报告的结果相反，不受全文支持。指控者关于原文报告beta功率下降的描述有明确依据。需要区分功率（power）和样本熵（Sample Entropy）：论文报告FOG期间增加的是alpha SampEn，而不是beta power；不能将神经熵增加解释为beta功率增加。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "da158d82-98ec-4821-991f-54d04e46942f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T114802924850Z", "elapsed_seconds": 28.75, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T11:48:31.681650+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d17a26862886413101edbcc0e0b465627ac763107465d6f2c77a9dbe406d13da", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_t